<h3>The Necessity of Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Standard vehicle insurance policies typically exclude coverage for damage occurring during professional transit or while the vehicle is in the custody of a logistics company. Therefore, standard policies are insufficient for protecting your asset during the journey to Muddebihal.</p>
<p>To mitigate this risk, you must opt for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. This specialized coverage is designed specifically for goods in transit, including vehicles. It provides full financial protection up to the declared market value of your bike, covering risks such as accidental damage, theft, or fire during the shipment.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Unlike basic coverage, which may have significant deductibles or caps, 100% declared-value insurance ensures that if the worst happens, you are compensated for the full value you have declared, without hidden limitations.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This layer of protection is non-negotiable for high-end motorcycles and is strongly recommended for all two-wheelers to provide complete peace of mind throughout the transit duration.</span></li></ul></div>
